f snakes can help you manage your ranch, be it by helping you feed other snakes, carrying their scales to storages, felling trees, hunting for food, forging new equipment and even cooking.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ORGANIZE EXPEDITIONS TO FIND RARE MATERIALS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291850/extras/c29a7e2ba7b69f5cef0467ab9339b8d3.avif?t=1767371934\" width=594 height=190 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send your fighter and gatherer snakes to explore new lands and collect rare resources and food. Some of the areas will be underwater or high in the sky and others will be too hot or too cold. Equip your scaly explorers to help them battle the elements or employ specialized species to get the job done.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAN AROUND TIME, WEATHER AND CHANGING SEASONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291850/extras/2e93b3cc5290ffcde142ef4fd04dbcb7.avif?t=1767371934\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291850/extras_big/2e93b3cc5290ffcde142ef4fd04dbcb7.avif?t=1767371934 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take time into account and make sure your snakes needs are met each day. Be prepared for weather that can affect your snakes work and changing seasons that bring new mechanics to the mix.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RESEARCH &amp; DEVELOPMENT</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291850/extras/34dc330c9c93283a2924f1485211eb15.avif?t=1767371934\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291850/extras_big/34dc330c9c93283a2924f1485211eb15.avif?t=1767371934 width=800 height=450 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a lab and with the help of your snakes, perform research to unlock new types of snakes, buildings and improvements for your ranch.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DECORATE AND MAKE IT YOUR OWN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291850/extras/ab7a25c4a2d98ea1db1e20498ebff341.apng?t=1767371934\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291850/extras/ab7a25c4a2d98ea1db1e20498ebff341.poster.avif?t=1767371934\" class=\"bb_img\" width=594 height=300 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a variety of decorative items and add your own style to your ranch. Just because you are scaling up, doesn\u2019t mean you cannot do a glow up instead.</p>","developers":["Flannel Bear Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291850/header.jpg?t=1767371934","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS Monterey<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 700 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3291850/793305/b202dd5e5428d124011f4f7d8655b7921a0f1883/1750976375/dash_av1.mpd?t=1732991850","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3291850/793305/b202dd5e5428d124011f4f7d8655b7921a0f1883/1750976375/dash_h264.mpd